    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "From getting tattoos to smoking pot, there are countless things out there that many people do which society may not see as normal. Why is it that others are quickly judged when they reveal a tattoo, despite it being something which has crossed the mind of many others? What is it that deems smoking marijuana, a casual and common recreational activity especially for college students, as something to be avoided? Tune in as we raise these questions and explore beyond the surface level meaning of the word \"normal.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
